        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“That choice will change both your fate and the girl’s.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—On a shrine path swirling with strange disturbances, every step you take with the girl is put to the test—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaei Shrine</strong> is a Japanese-style light horror adventure in which the player guides a girl dressed as a shrine maiden toward a mountain shrine plagued by unsettling phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie sounds, sudden presences, and things that should never appear…<br>As you walk alongside the girl, a boundary between the real world and the otherworld unfolds before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the girl’s fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the shrine maiden girl, who can no longer reach the shrine at the summit due to a sinister aura, safely to the shrine.<br>If you notice an anomaly, take the <strong>left path</strong>.<br>If nothing seems out of place, proceed along the <strong>right path</strong> and continue escorting her toward the shrine at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an <strong>“Exit 8–like”</strong> title inspired by games such as <i>The Exit 8</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two difficulty levels: <strong>Normal</strong> and <strong>Hard</strong>.<br>(We recommend starting with Normal. Even Normal may feel challenging.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime is <strong>15 to 90 minutes</strong>.<br>(If you clear it quickly, we recommend playing again—you may notice different anomalies or get a different feel.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless of difficulty, clearing the game unlocks special elements.<br>(Carve your name among the top ranks with the unlocked content!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>very few horror elements</strong>, so even players who dislike horror should be able to enjoy the game comfortably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, enjoy chatting with the girl, and keep an eye out for anomalies.<br>However, be careful—repeating conversations too persistently might make her dislike you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For information about the game, please check the threads on the <strong>Bulletin Board</strong> within this page.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following section contains <strong>helpful tips that may be hard to notice while playing</strong>.<br>They may feel like minor spoilers, but they only include small bits of trivia and nothing significant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please see <strong>[Helpful Tips for Things That Are Hard to Understand While Playing…]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game performance feels slow or heavy, please refer to <strong>[If the Game Performance Is Slow]</strong> on the Bulletin Board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Video Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an individual or a company, you're free to share gameplay videos, livestreams, or Let's Plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game’s title in your video title and a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settings for Using a Gamepad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The settings have been posted on the YaeiJinja [Community Hub] → [Guide] page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can go to the [Bulletin Board] on the page and access the [Guide] page from there.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“That choice will change both your fate and the girl’s.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—On a shrine path swirling with strange disturbances, every step you take with the girl is put to the test—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaei Shrine</strong> is a Japanese-style light horror adventure in which the player guides a girl dressed as a shrine maiden toward a mountain shrine plagued by unsettling phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie sounds, sudden presences, and things that should never appear…<br>As you walk alongside the girl, a boundary between the real world and the otherworld unfolds before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the girl’s fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the shrine maiden girl, who can no longer reach the shrine at the summit due to a sinister aura, safely to the shrine.<br>If you notice an anomaly, take the <strong>left path</strong>.<br>If nothing seems out of place, proceed along the <strong>right path</strong> and continue escorting her toward the shrine at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an <strong>“Exit 8–like”</strong> title inspired by games such as <i>The Exit 8</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two difficulty levels: <strong>Normal</strong> and <strong>Hard</strong>.<br>(We recommend starting with Normal. Even Normal may feel challenging.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime is <strong>15 to 90 minutes</strong>.<br>(If you clear it quickly, we recommend playing again—you may notice different anomalies or get a different feel.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless of difficulty, clearing the game unlocks special elements.<br>(Carve your name among the top ranks with the unlocked content!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>very few horror elements</strong>, so even players who dislike horror should be able to enjoy the game comfortably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, enjoy chatting with the girl, and keep an eye out for anomalies.<br>However, be careful—repeating conversations too persistently might make her dislike you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For information about the game, please check the threads on the <strong>Bulletin Board</strong> within this page.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following section contains <strong>helpful tips that may be hard to notice while playing</strong>.<br>They may feel like minor spoilers, but they only include small bits of trivia and nothing significant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please see <strong>[Helpful Tips for Things That Are Hard to Understand While Playing…]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game performance feels slow or heavy, please refer to <strong>[If the Game Performance Is Slow]</strong> on the Bulletin Board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Video Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an individual or a company, you're free to share gameplay videos, livestreams, or Let's Plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game’s title in your video title and a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settings for Using a Gamepad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The settings have been posted on the YaeiJinja [Community Hub] → [Guide] page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can go to the [Bulletin Board] on the page and access the [Guide] page from there.</p>",
